      "message": "As noted on b/575506671, since this slowdown only occurs with `SK_DEBUG` enabled (`SkDynamicMemoryWStream::validate()`) and release builds take 27–61 ms, we don\u0027t plan to add `SK_DEBUG` workarounds in `SkFontDescriptor::serialize`.\nAlso note that replacing `stream-\u003ewriteStream(fontStream.get(), length)` with `SkStreamPriv::Copy(stream, fontStream.get())` drops `length` after `writePackedUInt(length)` has already been written, so an early EOF on a non-memory-backed stream would return `true` after writing fewer than `length` bytes.",
